Build Go Cycling with its existing local store.
Use the checked-in default alternate icons.
Remove the iCloud and push entitlements tied to upstream signing while preserving HealthKit.
Omit the private TelemetryDeck configuration and hide its settings section.
Upstream iCloud integration: https://github.com/AnthonyH93/GoCycling/pull/5
Upstream telemetry control: https://github.com/AnthonyH93/GoCycling/pull/15
Backport the NSNumber overload fix from https://github.com/AnthonyH93/GoCycling/pull/32.

